[00:00.33]What a Wonderful World (Live) - 陈奕迅
[00:01.33]原唱：Louis Armstrong
[00:01.90]Lyrics by：Robert Thiele/George David Weiss
[00:02.86]Composed by：Robert Thiele/George David Weiss
[00:09.82]I see trees of green red roses too
[00:19.52]我能看见绿树红花
[00:19.52]I see them bloom for me and you
[00:26.33]我看见它们为你我怒放生命
[00:26.33]And I think to myself
[00:31.87]我心想
[00:31.87]What a wonderful world
[00:41.36]这是多么美妙的世界
[00:41.36]I see skies of blue and clouds of white
[00:50.90]我能看见蓝天白云
[00:50.90]The bright blessed day
[00:54.51]明媚之日
[00:54.51]The dark sacred night
[00:57.60]神圣之夜
[00:57.60]And I think to myself
[01:03.43]我心想
[01:03.43]What a wonderful world
[01:13.48]这是多么美妙的世界
[01:13.48]The colors of the rainbow
[01:16.85]架向天空的彩虹
[01:16.85]So pretty in the sky
[01:20.27]颜色如此缤纷
[01:20.27]Are also on the faces of people going by
[01:26.77]洒落在路上行人的脸上
[01:26.77]I see friends shaking hands
[01:30.47]我看见朋友们握手
[01:30.47]Saying how do you do
[01:35.15]问好
[01:35.15]They're really saying I love you
[01:46.13]他们真诚地说着我爱你
[01:46.13]I hear babies cry I watch them grow
[01:55.18]我能听见宝宝哭喊 我看着它们在茁壮成长
[01:55.18]They learn much more
[01:58.10]他们将会学习无数知识
[01:58.10]Than I'll never know
[02:01.98]会远超我所知道的
[02:01.98]And I think to myself
[02:08.13]我心想
[02:08.13]What a wonderful world